<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FORECAST - S.AFRICAN COMPANY RESULTS CONSENSUS.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - S.AFRICAN COMPANY RESULTS CONSENSUS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts estimates of major</p>
<p>South African company results expected next week include the</p>
<p>following (all figures cents per share):</p>
<p>DAY--COMPANY------------PERIOD--CONSENSUS----RANGE---------PVS--</p>
<p>TUE  De Beers  YR EPS     1,301     1,197-1,400   938</p>
<p>TUE  De Beers  YR DIV     415.4     370-447	 339.0</p>
<p>THU  Anglovaal H1 EPS     497.7     490.1-509.0   377.0</p>
<p>THU  Anglovaal H1 DIV     62.2	61.1-63.5     47.0</p>
<p>				     ooOOoo </p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
